geekbench7-linux (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix run passthrough so Geekbench flags like --gpu work without a leading --.
  * SonarCloud coverage path mapping and CI analysis hardening (from 1.0.0 follow-ups).

 -- Sergiu Alexandrescu <alexandrescu.sergiu@gmail.com>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:26:35 +0000

geekbench7-linux (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First stable release (1.0.0).
  * Wrapper-only packaging for official Geekbench 7 (amd64 and arm64).
  * Downloads from cdn.geekbench.com on the user's machine; never redistributes Geekbench.
  * SonarQube Cloud support with per-file coverage gate (>= 90%).
  * Not affiliated with Primate Labs; buy Geekbench at https://www.primatelabs.com/store/v7/.

 -- Sergiu Alexandrescu <alexandrescu.sergiu@gmail.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000
